Note = {40th IAHR World Congress, Vienna, AUSTRIA, AUG 21-25, 2023},
Abstract = {This paper analyzes the characteristics of groundwater aquifers and
   groundwater recharge characteristics in water source areas, establishes
   a three-dimensional hydrogeological conceptual model, and puts forward a
   model solution method and steps based on Galerkin finite element method.
   Taking a typical water source area in China as an example, the
   large-scale groundwater environment finite element numerical simulation
   software FEFLOW is used for simulation calculation. The results show
   that the method proposed in this study can quickly and accurately
   simulate the groundwater dynamics, and can provide technical support for
   the prediction and supervision of regional water resources supply and
   demand balance.},
