Abstract = {Interpersonal communication can be understood, explained and carried out
   effectively without reference to the concept itself, which involves self
   awareness, but also of others, and understanding the role of
   communication in the growth and self-assertion, but also in personality
   development. Psychoanalysis researchers argue that the first law of life
   is not biological self-preservation, but preservation of self-image,
   which is strictly a basic human need. The image, say of itself, comes
