Abstract = {The emissions of greenhouse gases and their potential impact on climate
   change are more than just a debate on the scientific uncertainties; it
   is perhaps the dominant public policy issue as we begin this century.
   Issues of international interests, economics, energy technology and
   public perception drive the complexity of the climate change issue for
   businesses and industries. Since 1997, Texaco has compiled comprehensive
   annual emissions inventories of its worldwide operations and interests.
