   Teoretica; Romanian Soc Med Bioengineering; Romanian Acad, Iasi Branch,
   Inst Comp Sci; IEEE EMB Romania Chapter; IEEE EMC Romania Chapter; IEEE
   Signal Proc Romania Chapter; IEEE SMC Romania Chapter},
Abstract = {The COVID-19 pandemic catalyzed a dramatic change in medical education
   paradigm, mediating a wider use of technology and adoption of open
   education models. In this paper, we analyze the challenges encountered
   along the way from the production of educational 360-degree video
   scenarios to their actual use in medical teaching. Evaluation was
   two-fold: (a) medical students' perception and attitude towards this
   technology and its actual effectiveness in teaching; (b) feed-back from
   the teachers and medical staff. The feed-back and concrete debriefing
   refer to the required one-semester course on emergency medicine taught
   during the autumn of 2020, when such videos were employed as a
   substitute for practical classes.},
