   FITNESS AND HEALTH, VOL 2},
Year = {2010},
Pages = {173-175},
Note = {International Symposium on Children and Youth Fitness and Health,
   Nanjing, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 28-31, 2010},
Abstract = {As an organic component of sports, great deeds of humanitarianism and
   parts of charity, disabled sports has drawn the attention of more and
   more developed and developing countries. Along with the development of
   social politics, economics, education, sports and medical affairs,
   disabled physical training gains more supports from all circles in our
   society. Disabled physical training is the best choice for the
   handicapped in that it not only improves the body enginery during the
   training but also strengthens the volition and eliminates the passive
   emotion of the handicapped. What is more, disabled sports teach the
   involved to communicate and cooperate with others, thus to enhance the
   ability of social communication. The disabled sport is an effective
   means for the disabled to get into the social communications. Various
   sports enable the handicapped to take part in some group activities,
   which help them establish self-confidence and self-esteem. Disabled
   physical training is a getting-well instrument, which is even better
   than medical treatment. A disabled sport is a sport phenomena formed in
   daily experiments by the handicapped.. It is the main content of the
   National Fitness Movement as well as an important evaluation guide line
   of mass physical training. In modern society, health is the precondition
   of every social activity. Focusing on health, especially the health
   condition of the handicapped is a forever topic.},
